"""Synthetic training corpus: short blessings in four themes, generated from a grammar.

Every line is "<theme> words ... ." with at most MAXWORDS tokens after the theme (punctuation counts).
"<name>" is a slot the contract fills with the caller's name or address. No outside text is used, so the
corpus can be regenerated byte for byte from this file.
"""
